<title>MALAYSIA: Hong Leong Industries yr net off 6 pct.</title>
<headline>Hong Leong Industries yr net off 6 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended June 30</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit	    111.42	 vs	 117.97</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)    79.4	  vs	  84.1</p>
<p>    Turnover	    2,181.79	 vs     1,471.12</p>
<p>    Dividend (pct)	 27.0	  vs	  25.0</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	208.21	 vs	 164.25</p>
<p>    Minorities	less 86.20	 vs   less 17.88</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries less 11.37	 vs	  87.32</p>
<p>NOTE: Hong Leong Industries Bhd is involved in investment holding, making mosaic and ceramic tiles and other products.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603 230 8911)</p>
</text>
